  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/the-angel-next-door-spoils-me-rotten-gui-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fthe-angel-next-door-spoils-me-rotten-gui-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/N8tUm6N4Qc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"discord-plural\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Kesselspacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/social/youtube-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"youtube-plural\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fkesselot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/kofi-singular-alt_vector.svg\" alt=\"kofi-singular-alt\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftinyurl.com%252famy67484\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/documentation/website_vector.svg\" alt=\"website\"></a></p><h1>概述</h1><p>來自備受喜愛的動畫/漫畫/輕小說《隔壁的天使》。享受一款全面翻新的Minecraft GUI體驗，包含所有可愛的角色，當然還有天使椎名真晝和她的男友藤宮周。</p><h1>預覽 - 更多內容請查看畫廊！</h1><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/suOsV29K/images/363eb27a41b628cf3227e2c0d202e83f371220a4.png\" alt=\"大型儲物箱選單\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/suOsV29K/images/896047d0d883c47ade2a1e78d8194ee57147a0f1.png\" alt=\"鐵砧選單\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/suOsV29K/images/98ef9cdb2af476c2fc34969c8a64126cf3ee13f0.png\" alt=\"鍛造台選單\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftinyurl.com%252famy67484\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/39e1d151-f787-4346-9014-f14dc996f94e.webp\" alt=\"Banner Bisecthosting\"></a></p><h3>資源包備註</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>如果您是使用此資源包的Youtuber或內容創作者，請在說明中附上連結回連到此頁面，以便他人知道您使用的是該資源包。</strong></li>\n<li><strong>禁止在Modrinth或CurseForge上重新上傳此資源包或任何修改版本，亦禁止轉發至其他任何網站。</strong>（<em>除非獲得我本人的明確許可</em>）</li>\n</ul>",
